{
    "title": "Solitaire - Classic Card Game",
    "description": "\u2660\ufe0f \u2663\ufe0f \u2665 \ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\r\nClassic Solitaire is the world's most classic patience card game.\r\nWith Themes and Daily Challenges, get more fun on playing Solitaire. \r\n\u2660\ufe0f \u2663\ufe0f \u2665 \ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\r\n\r\nFeature: \r\n\u2665 Solvable decks make games easier\r\n\u2665 Draw 1 card (Easy) \r\n\u2665 Draw 3 cards (Hard) \r\n\u2665 Tons of themes, backgrounds, card back styles\r\n\u2665 Single tap to place a card or drag and drop\r\n\u2665 Standard Solitaire scoring \r\n\u2665 Smart hints show potentially useful moves \r\n\u2665 Auto-collect cards on completion\r\n\u2665 Auto-save game in play\r\n\u2665 Statistics all your scores\r\n\u2665 Daily challenges and achievements",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2660\ufe0f \u2663\ufe0f \u2665 \ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f<br>Classic Solitaire is the world&#39;s most classic patience card game.<br>With Themes and Daily Challenges, get more fun on playing Solitaire. <br>\u2660\ufe0f \u2663\ufe0f \u2665 \ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f<br><br>Feature: <br>\u2665 Solvable decks make games easier<br>\u2665 Draw 1 card (Easy) <br>\u2665 Draw 3 cards (Hard) <br>\u2665 Tons of themes, backgrounds, card back styles<br>\u2665 Single tap to place a card or drag and drop<br>\u2665 Standard Solitaire scoring <br>\u2665 Smart hints show potentially useful moves <br>\u2665 Auto-collect cards on completion<br>\u2665 Auto-save game in play<br>\u2665 Statistics all your scores<br>\u2665 Daily challenges and achievements",
